      "source_notes": "Original Timmkoo SR1 software **R1P_V2-V2.05.20251011**.\n\n- Model: **SR1** (Timmkoo)\n- Package: `rom_sr1.zip`\n- Build tag: `R1P_V2-V2.05.20251011`\n- Build date: 2025-10-11\n\n## Install\n\n1. Download `rom_sr1.zip` (every numbered volume if the release has more than one, then `cat rom_sr1.zip.* > rom_sr1.zip`).\n2. Unzip it. Keep the scatter file next to the images.\n3. Open SP Flash Tool, choose **Download Only**, load the scatter file from the archive and flash.\n4. Or use Innioasis Updater CE: <https://innioasis.app/guide.html>\n\nThis wipes the player. Back up music and recordings first.\n\n## Files\n\n| File | Size |\n| --- | --- |\n| `rom_sr1.zip` | 933.8 MB |\n| `SHA256SUMS` | 0.0 MB |\n\nFull archive: <https://innioasis.app/firmware.html?model=SR1>",
